# Esc with a box of the panel open closes the box, not the window (scripts\verify\panel.ps1, part esc), live:
#   RayTracingViewer cornell -w 640 --height 360 -s 32 --input tests\window-panel-esc.input
# After Esc the strategy's box is opened again and material chosen in it, then the view saved. Had Esc closed the
# window, nothing would follow; had the box stayed open, the second click on its control would close it, and the
# click on material would find no such control on screen: an error that ends the run.
at 0 action panel on
at 20 click sampling
at 30 key Escape
at 40 click sampling
at 50 click sampling material
at 70 action save
at 90 quit
